# The opening text, with each way of holding and tapping A and B.

# The logos, the title, and a new game in file 1.
.:900 T:4 .:300
A:4 .:300

# A held across a page and past where the next one starts: the page waits for it to be let go.
A:300 .:90
# B held: it doesn't turn the page or hurry the text.
B:300 .:90
# A tapped while the text prints finishes the page at once; then a tap turns it.
.:10 A:3 .:30 A:3 .:60
# B tapped through a pause, a few times.
6x B:3 .:15
.:60
# A and B together, held.
BA:200 .:90
# The rest of the opening, by taps, until it has done.
40x A:3 .:60
.:120
